flowchart TD
    ORCH[Orchestrator] --> NAV[Navigator]
    ORCH --> ORACLE[Oracle]
    ORCH --> FIXERS[Completed fixer batch]
    FIXERS --> RECONCILE[Reconcile all fixer reports and changed paths]
    RECONCILE --> PACKET[One combined batch packet]
    PACKET --> REVIEWER[Reviewer pipeline]
    REVIEWER --> FOCUSES[Selected focus catalog]
    FOCUSES --> INVOCATIONS[Fresh invocations, max 10 per batch]
    INVOCATIONS --> REPORT[One consolidated health-first batch report]
    REPORT --> USER[User chooses fix, defer, or accept findings - report-only]
    REPORT --> DEPENDENTS[Release dependents after report reconciliation]
    DEPENDENTS --> FINAL[Mandatory full-branch final review report]
    FINAL --> HANDOFF[Handoff or commit authorization]
    FINAL --> SECURITY[Separate Git security scan before commit]
